~ wrong_words
Roro: "You are much smarter than you look!"
Roro: "Your beauty is something I cherish. You clean up very nicely for a rat."
Roro: "I love you Xiu. Forever and ever!"
Roro: "Sincerely, your lover, Macaron."
Rat King: Hah? That's your pathetic excuse of love?
Xiu: Did Macaron really write that...? I don't want to believe it.
#nervous roro expression
Roro: Uh. wait no… WAIT SHE REALLY DIDN’T SAY THAT.
Rat King: Disgusting, really, that your so called “lover” had this little creature deliver that. 
Xiu: …
Roro: Xiu! That’s really not what she wrote I swear. 
#sad xiu expression
Xiu: Maybe I should stay here with the Rat King… just for a bit. 
Rat King: Well… we do have some room.
#nervous roro expression
Roro: WAIT NO, STOP IT. 
#neutral xiu expression
Xiu: Roro, my friend, I suggest you leave and tell Macaron that… we maybe need a break.
Roro: NO! Let me go outside and catch my breath. I was just nervous ya know!
Roro: Couldn’t really uh… read. Ya know she writes it cursive, that's really hard!
