~ right_words
Roro: "Words cannot describe how enamored I am with you! Your intellect is something to applaud."
Roro: "Not only is your knowledge most attractive, your beauty is something I cherish."
Roro: "From your clothes, to your fur, to your alluring eyes I cannot help but fall more and more in love with you."
Roro: "I love you Xiu. Forever and ever!"
Roro: "Sincerely, your lover, Macaron."
Rat King: W-wow… I never knew love so pure could exist…
#happy roro expression
Roro: Yes, so pure. It brings a tear to my eye. 
#neutral xiu expression
Xiu curtsied, tilting her head down into a slight bow. 
Xiu: Your graces, please. I must go see my love. She needs me… I need her…
Rat King: ...
Roro: …
Rat King: I will allow it. 
Xiu: !
Roro: !
Rat King: GO! Before I change my mind…
Roro: You do not have to tell me twice. LETS GO 
Xiu: T-thank you, your graces.
With one last curtsy, because you're very polite, you and Xiu scamper off to the exit of the Rat Kings lair.
Rat King: … 
Rat King: That little creature was right… there love is quite nice 
Rat King: Maybe we should get some couples therapy. 
Rat King 1: Yeah, I second that. 
Rat King 2: We really do need it.
=> END

